title: "Exact guessing probability for almost-qudit sources"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Zhang
    given-names: Yongxian
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0000-3864-3536"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-11-27
repository-code: "https://github.com/mxym/math"
abstract: "Proves tightness of the almost-dimension label-guessing bound conjectured after Equation (221) of arXiv:2610.20725v1, for every allowed dimension, uniform label ensemble and leakage parameter. Gives a separate exact allocation formula for nonuniform priors and unequal per-label budgets. No correlated quantum side information, prescribed-target fidelity or key-rate claim."
